    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yefitha kodi Joefrayim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwo ma Efrayim jocokere kanyacel to joŋado kadho yumalo, aka jopenjo Yefitha ni, “Raŋo iŋado kadho i lweny gi Joamon, aka ikilwoŋo wan kadho kodin? Walawaŋo ot perin gi mac i wiyin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefitha odwoko jo ni, “An kodi ji paran wabedo gi dhaw madwoŋ gi Joamon; aka alwoŋo win, to wikibino bothan wok i cingi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo aneno nike wikinyalo bothan, aketho kwo paran i cingan, aka aŋado lweny gi Joamon; to Rwoth miyo jo i cingan. Raŋo nyo wibino ndelo me lweny kodan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefitha ocoko cwo je ma Giliad aka jolweny gi Joefrayim. Cwo ma Giliad joneko Joefrayim, kwoŋbedo jowaco ni, “Win Jogiliad, wibedo jom'orwenyo ma Efrayim kodi Manase.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jogiliad jomako ger ma Yordan kwoŋ Joefrayim. Kisi ka Jaefrayim kwale to waco ni, “Weyi akadhi koca.” Cwo ma Giliad jopenjo go ni, “Ibedo Jaefrayim?” Aka go odwoko ni be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco rigo tuco wac Siboleth, aka go oyido tuco ni Siboleth, kwoŋbedo go oyido kinyal tuco m'otire. Kenyo oyido jomako go to joneko go i ger ma Yordan. Joefrayim 42,000 jotho i hongo no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefitha obedo jathum banja i Isiraili ma oro aucel. Go otho aka oyiki go i tindin madongo ma Giliad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibizan, Elon kodi Abidon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen pa Yefitha, Ibizan ma wok i Bethelehem obedo jathum banja i Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido nitie gi wote piero adek kodi nyithindho manyir piero adek m'opoko i nywomirok woko ma nono pere; to bende kelo nyir piero adek woko ma nono pere ri wote. Ibizan othumo banja i Isiraili ma oro abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go otho aka oyiki i Bethelehem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen pa Ibizan, Elon janono pa Zebulun obedo jathum banja i Isiraili ma oro apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elon otho, aka oyiki go i Ayijalon i lowo ma Zebulun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen pa Elon, Abidon wod pa Hilal ja Pirathon obedo jathum banja i Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido nitie gi wote piero aŋwen, kodi nyikwaye piero adek, m'oyido jogweyo punde piero abirio. Go othumo banja i Isiraili ma oro aboro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abidon otho, aka oyiki go i Pirathon i lowo pa Efrayim, i piny matendere pa Joamalek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
